# live recording: tap REC to arm, PLAY records at once (no waiting); chords on the conductor land on its
# beat steps, a new chord replacing the step's old one; REC held shows the record settings
wait 300
turn ALGO 8
expect trk 9
tap SEQ
tap REC
expect playing 0
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
wait 480
key 0 down
key 4 down
key 7 down
wait 120
key 0 up
key 4 up
key 7 up
wait 300
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
expect note 9 1 2 53
# again over it: the new chord replaces the old one on that step
tap REC
tap PLAY
wait 480
key 2 down
key 5 down
key 9 down
wait 120
key 2 up
key 5 up
key 9 up
wait 300
tap PLAY
expect note 9 1 2 55
# punch in and out while playing, on T2
turn ALGO -7
expect trk 2
tap PLAY
tap REC
wait 200
tapkey 0
wait 100
tap REC
wait 200
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
# REC held: the record settings on the knobs
press REC
turn K1 1
turn K2 1
wait 60
shot rec_knobs.png
release REC
expect playing 0
